  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo></math> Reaction between <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Fe</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>HCl</mi></math> is as follows</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Fe</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>HCl</mi><mo>&#10230;</mo><munder><msub><mi>FeCl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mrow><mo>(</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></munder><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> on reaction</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></math>(moles of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Fe</mi></math>)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></math> (moles of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>HCl</mi></math>)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>Fe</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo></math> Normality <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>HCl</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#215;</mo></math> Volume of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>HCl</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfenced><mi>Fe</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>500</mn></mrow><mn>1000</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>moles</mi></math></p><p>As each <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Fe</mi></math> consumers <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math> electrons to change to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> ion.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Number of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> ions produced <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mole</mi></math></p>"
  }
